        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Task Decomposition for Dev Workflows (Task Statement 1.6)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Two patterns — know when each applies:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Pattern"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "When"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Example"
          }
        ]
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "Fixed sequential pipeline (prompt chaining)"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Predictable, multi-aspect work"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Code review: analyze each file individually → separate cross-file integration pass"
            }
          ]
        ],
        [
          [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "Dynamic adaptive decomposition"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Open-ended investigation where each step's findings shape the next"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "\"Add comprehensive tests to this legacy codebase\""
            }
          ]
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "definition",
      "term": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Legacy-testing decomposition (canonical example)"
        }
      ],
      "spans": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "map the structure first → identify high-impact areas → create a "
        },
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "prioritized plan that adapts"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " as dependencies are discovered. Not a fixed upfront file list."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "definition",
      "term": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Per-file + integration split rationale"
        }
      ],
      "spans": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "analyzing many files at once dilutes attention (inconsistent depth, missed bugs, contradictory findings). Local pass per file + one dedicated cross-file data-flow pass."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
